  "notes": "Godan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}), く row.\n- Negative: {欠|か}かない\n- Polite: {欠|か}きます\n- Te-form: {欠|か}いて\n- Past: {欠|か}いた\n- Potential: {欠|か}ける\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive ({他動詞|たどうし}). The intransitive counterpart is {欠|か}ける (to be chipped, to be lacking).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{欠|か}く: to lack ~, to be without ~\n- {欠|か}くことのできない: indispensable, essential\n- {欠|か}かせない: indispensable (from the causative-negative)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {礼儀|れいぎ}を{欠|か}く: to lack manners\n- {配慮|はいりょ}を{欠|か}く: to lack consideration\n- {常識|じょうしき}を{欠|か}く: to lack common sense\n- {誠意|せいい}を{欠|か}く: to lack sincerity\n- {欠|か}かせない{存在|そんざい}: an indispensable presence",
